HTML:
```html
<table id="myTable">
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th onclick="sortTable(0)">Name</th>
      <th onclick="sortTable(1)">Age</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td>John</td>
      <td>25</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
